# Perfect Rent & Remind – API Endpoints

Base URL:

```text
http://localhost:5000/api
```

Authentication:

```text
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
```

Dates:

```text
Full timestamps are returned as ISO-8601 UTC strings (e.g. 2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z).
Date-only request and query values use YYYY-MM-DD (e.g. 2026-10-20) and are interpreted as UTC calendar dates.
Rental duration and late days are calculated using calendar-date differences under this UTC date-only convention. The return date is the end boundary for rental duration, so 2026-10-20 through 2026-10-22 represents 2 rental days.
```

Pagination defaults (all paginated list endpoints):

```text
page = 1
limit = 12
```

